5161597.048700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"nuta/nsh","id":1,"title":"nuta/nsh","text":"A command-line shell like fish, but POSIX compatible.","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"440","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Rust","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UkKT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"669d5e7f-465d-41af-8247-b89014b1a96c","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"このへん自前でやってるとちょっと面倒……","ts":"1635159763.048600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KV+3N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3baa48b5-e995-4a7e-8943-55397e7ed16f","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"他のクライアントはわかりませんがvim-lspだと移動する際にタグスタック更新してくれますね\n\u003chttps://github.com/prabirshrestha/vim-lsp/blob/7b9da239da68e21aacc96cb77b44b5a669038b2b/autoload/lsp/utils/tagstack.vim\u003e","ts":"1635159729.048100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/prabirshrestha/vim-lsp/blob/7b9da239da68e21aacc96cb77b44b5a669038b2b/autoload/lsp/utils/tagstack.vim | tagstack.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/prabirshrestha/vim-lsp/blob/7b9da239da68e21aacc96cb77b44b5a669038b2b/autoload/lsp/utils/tagstack.vim | tagstack.vim\u003e","text":"```\nif exists('*gettagstack') \u0026amp;\u0026amp; exists('*settagstack')\n    function! lsp#utils#tagstack#_update() abort\n        let l:bufnr = bufnr('%')\n        let l:item = {'bufnr': l:bufnr, 'from': [l:bufnr, line('.'), col('.'), 0], 'tagname': expand('\u0026lt;cword\u0026gt;')}\n        let l:winid = win_getid()\n\n        let l:stack = gettagstack(l:winid)\n        if l:stack['length'] == l:stack['curidx']\n            \" Replace the last items with item.\n            let l:action = 'r'\n            let l:stack['items'][l:stack['curidx']-1] = l:item\n        elseif l:stack['length'] \u0026gt; l:stack['curidx']\n            \" Replace items after used items with item.\n            let l:action = 'r'\n            if l:stack['curidx'] \u0026gt; 1\n                let l:stack['items'] = add(l:stack['items'][:l:stack['curidx']-2], l:item)\n            else\n                let l:stack['items'] = [l:item]\n            endif\n        else\n            \" Append item.\n            let l:action = 'a'\n            let l:stack['items'] = [l:item]\n        endif\n        let l:stack['curidx'] += 1\n\n        call settagstack(l:winid, l:stack, l:action)\n    endfunction\nelse\n    function! lsp#utils#tagstack#_update() abort\n        \" do nothing\n    endfunction\nendif\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/prabirshrestha/vim-lsp|prabirshrestha/vim-lsp\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3xgq5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1D4CE592-F74F-45DF-B881-5EA73436DD06","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分の場合fzf-previewでcocのAPIから値を取得してからジャンプしてるんで、そこについては自分でやらないといけなそう","ts":"1635157332.047500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=NTx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecff0b92-7197-4796-9af6-4ac881b3220e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実はすでにやってたりしないんだろうか。これ完全に LSP 向けの API だし","ts":"1635157244.045600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ihk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ED9E4EB9-AAEA-4317-B0F2-7C3AFC74CABE","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"LSP経由のジャンプで基本的に割り込んで処理させよう","ts":"1635157156.045000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MI2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E83590BD-A9FB-469C-9F11-844DC4A932E2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これめっちゃやりたいなぁ","ts":"1635157085.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J7r0t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41C13EEF-382B-49D0-8042-C4780A643D4B","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"おー","ts":"1635157070.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s+N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b53dd25-8864-46c3-8955-b8ad41c051d4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"APIはある","ts":"1635157056.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S8=L"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nsettagstack({nr}, {dict} [, {action}])                  *settagstack()*\n                {dict}を使用してウィンドウ{nr}のタグスタックを変更する。\n                {nr}にはウィンドウ番号または |window-ID| を指定できる。\n \n                {dict}でサポートされている項目のリストについては、\n                |gettagstack()| を参照。\"curidx\" はタグスタックを変更する前に\n                効果を生じる。\n```","ts":"1635157051.043000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"45ccee91-c6a8-41cc-aa7b-6acfb4a358ce","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h settagstack()","ts":"1635157051.042900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HW+G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CED1901F-3020-43B0-82F0-F3CC1FDE8BB6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"できるならReferencesで飛ぶ時にもタグスタック追加したい","ts":"1635157044.042700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7C6D1EA0-5599-428B-822E-FB8B6A2730C7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そういえば、タグジャンプじゃないジャンプをする時にタグスタックを追加するみたいなのってできます？","ts":"1635157025.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S2m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EC88256B-6765-4096-AA3F-4CBDEBA75C45","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF",